MERN 15 || Final Assignment



Welcome to your final Assignment. In this, you have to create a full-stack news portal website. 



Technology:
FrontEnd: React Js, Tailwind Css or Bootstrap or Raw Css, Zustand or Redux

Backend: Express Js, Node js , MongoDB




Functional Requirements:
1. Home page, it will have 4-5 sections. The top 6 news will be shown in any one section (Need api Call).

2. News page, Here all the news will be shown for users. (Need Api call)

3. Single News Details Page (Need Api Call) 

4. Login and register Page where user can login and register (Api Call) 

5. Registered user can create his own news and publish to this website (Api call)

6. User Dashbaord or Profile Page where user can update his user information ( Api call)

7. Register User can edit or delete his news from user profile or the dashboard (api call)

4. Contact Us Page

5. Header & footer